Ryogami wallpaper picker
========================

This is the Qt Quick wallpaper picker for the Ryoku desktop (the "Ryoku.Ryogami"
QML module and its C++ card renderer).

Its interface, picker styles, card shader, motion model and settings folio are a
port of skwd-wall v2, by liixini (https://github.com/liixini/skwd-wall), which is
distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later. Because the
picker derives from that work, it is licensed under the same terms; the full text
is in the LICENSE file beside this notice.

The Duel picker style (src/layouts/duellayout.cpp) follows the wallpaper picker
in Serpantinum by ilyamiro (https://github.com/ilyamiro/serpantinum): one row of
slanted cards where the chosen card stands tall and its neighbours narrow with
distance. It is written fresh for this renderer and copies no Serpantinum code.

The card shader (shaders/card.frag, shaders/card.vert) is a GLSL port of skwd
item.wgsl. Wallpaper Engine playback is rendered by skwd-paper, packaged
separately as skwd-paper-bin.

Like skwd-wall, the module embeds two fonts: Roboto Condensed Bold (the "UI"
subset skwd ships), under the Apache License 2.0, and Symbols Nerd Font from the
Nerd Fonts project, under the MIT License. Their licence texts are in
qml/theme/fonts/ and ship beside this notice.
